        "content": "### Sheet: tab named `Requests`\nSame sheet as the quote follow-up template. To create it, paste this line in cell A1, then Data > Split text to columns:\n`request_id,received_at,status,name,email,phone,service,address,preferred_date,details,missing_fields,quote_id,quote_amount,thread_id,quote_sent_at,follow_ups_sent,last_follow_up_at,reply_label,job_start,event_id,closed_at`",
